factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the garbage is dumped and piled up 'from various areas' and that the buses 'come and go in this area' is roughly supported, but the reel_script's claim that Nallipalayam bypass bridge buses 'come and go in this area' is a loose reading of the article's list of destinations; the article lists buses going to Pazhayur, Namakkal New and Old Bus Stands, Collectorate, and the new government hospital, which the draft omits.
  The caption's summary says 'நான்கு பகுதிகளில் பயணியர் நிழற்கூடங்கள் உள்ளன' and the reel_script says 'இங்குள்ள நான்கு பகுதிகளில்', which is accurate, but the slide and reel text describe the shelters as being in the same area as the garbage, which the article does not state.
  The caption's closing sentence 'சுகாதாரச் சீர்கேட்டைத் தவிர்க்க குப்பையை முறையாக அகற்ற வேண்டும்' is an invented call to action (a demand for proper removal) not present in the article.
  The slides_spec 'loc' and the headline say 'நாமக்கல் பைபாஸ் சர்வீஸ் சாலை' and the first slide says 'நாமக்கல் - கரூர் பைபாஸ் சர்வீஸ் சாலைகளில', while the article only describes the Namakkal-Tiruchengode road and the Karur-Namakkal service roads; the phrase 'Namakkal - Karur bypass service roads' is a reasonable reading but the 'Namakkal Bypass' naming in the headline is a mild embellishment.
  The reel_script opens with 'மழை பெய்து வருவதால் குப்பை அழுகி துர்நாற்றம் அதிகமாகியுள்ளது', while the article says it is raining and the garbage rots and smells badly; 'அதிகமாகியுள்ளது' (has increased) is an added claim not stated in the article.
